<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-PSV BEAT RODA 3-1 TO WIN DUTCH SUPER CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PSV BEAT RODA 3-1 TO WIN DUTCH SUPER CUP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSV Eindhoven beat Roda JC</p>
<p>Kerkrade 3-1 (halftime 1-0) to win the Dutch Super Cup on</p>
<p>Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>PSV - Phlip Cocu 22, 90, Gilles de Bilde 90</p>
<p>Roda - Peter van Houdt 84</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
</text>
